    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "うぇ～～いっ！\nミラクルおたおめハピバちゃ～んっ☆",
            "enText": "Waheeey! Happy B the days 'cause we\ngot ourselves a B-day Miracle!☆",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 5453371312520442090,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイイチルビー",
            "enName": "Daiichi Ruby",
            "jpText": "お誕生日、お祝い申し上げます。\nどうか素晴らしい年になりますよう。",
            "enText": "Happy birthday. May you have \na wonderful year ahead.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -2121990270208798265,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ケイエスミラクル",
            "enName": "K.S.Miracle",
            "jpText": "わあ、ありがとう……！",
            "enText": "Wow, thank you…!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4676522961480240977,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "てか、マジで派手にカマさんでいいの？\nミラんのためならウチ、\nダチ億かき集めっケド！",
            "enText": "Hey, you sure you don't wanna party? \nFor you, Miram, I'll assemble a gajillion peeps!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -4142960946184669170,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ケイエスミラクル",
            "enName": "K.S.Miracle",
            "jpText": "億はすごいなぁ。\nどんな場所ならみんな入れるかな？",
            "enText": "That's a lot of peeps. Where could we fit a \ngajillion people?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 2932158250790209181,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイイチルビー",
            "enName": "Daiichi Ruby",
            "jpText": "そのような施設は、\n地球上のどこにも存在しえないかと。",
            "enText": "I don't believe there's such a venue \nanywhere on this planet.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -976750377995387031,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "ぴえん～。\nミラクルも爆アゲしたいっしょ～！",
            "enText": "Come ooon, don't you wanna let loose?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 5334186313737789872,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイイチルビー",
            "enName": "Daiichi Ruby",
            "jpText": "……そう、お望みなのですか？",
            "enText": "…Is that what you want?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 6797591521036165852,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ケイエスミラクル",
            "enName": "K.S.Miracle",
            "jpText": "ふふ、2人とも本当に優しいね。\nおれを想ってくれる気持ちだけで充分だよ。\nそれが、1番のプレゼントだから。",
            "enText": "Heh, you guys are too kind. The sentiment \nis more than enough for me. It's the best \npresent I could ask for.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -897061971370283514,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ケイエスミラクル",
            "enName": "K.S.Miracle",
            "jpText": "……今年も感謝しないと。\n優しさに出会わせてくれた――\n“奇跡”に。",
            "enText": "…It's time to say another thank you… \nto the \"miracle\" that introduced me \nto such kindness.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 5190767183480975411,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
    "humanTl": true,
    "modified": 1784227090
}